<section>
  <h2>Decision</h2>
  <div class="decision red">
    <b>Open incident</b> — Customer impact and fault are confirmed by independent evidence; restoration workflow should begin.
  </div>
  <div class="kv">
    <span class="k">Policy</span><span class="v">Default ServiceNow incident policy (platform default — no tenant policy configured)</span>
    <span class="k">Ticket-open threshold</span><span class="v">verdict ≥ suspected, customer-facing evidence required, suspected additionally requires critical severity</span>
    <span class="k">Monitoring window</span><span class="v">30m 00s after recovery</span>
    <span class="k">Auto-close</span><span class="v">no recurrence and no NEW customer-impact evidence arising within the monitoring window (impact already recorded for this incident stays recorded and does not block a clean close)</span>
    <span class="k">Reopen</span><span class="v">the same condition recurs within 30m 00s (flap suppression)</span>
    <span class="k">Escalation</span><span class="v">TRIGGERED at 2026-07-12 20:00:00 UTC — further escalate if customer impact is confirmed, or a second independent evidence class corroborates the fault</span>
    <span class="k">Ticket recommendation</span><span class="v">Hold — validation scenario — production ticket side effects suppressed</span>
    <span class="k">Ticket execution</span><span class="v" style="font-weight:400">Escalation conditions are met while the ticket is held: validation scenario — production ticket side effects suppressed.</span>
  
  </div>
</section>

